      "description": "A man with Down syndrome is centrally positioned in the image, smiling broadly and looking directly at the camera. A text overlay reading 'the name's todd... retodd' is superimposed at the bottom of the image, creating a meme that relies on a phonetic pun involving a derogatory term related to developmental disabilities. The background is blurred, showing an indistinct indoor setting with other people faintly visible.",
