      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_47ce6bab",
      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the man with Down syndrome via the textual identity",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man with Down syndrome, as the text 'the name's todd... retodd' explicitly assigns an identity ('Todd') to him. This creates a direct semiotic projection where the user perceives themselves as identifying with or being represented by the man through the textual label, even though the label contains a derogatory pun. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'man' via the TextualMaterial 'text_chunk'.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
